# Sync Power Infusion with Voidform
# Use Desperate Prayer to heal up should Shadow Word: Death or other damage bring you below 75%

# Use Holy Nova during Halo to acquire Twist of Fate when Lightburst can heal an ally and Twist of Fate is not active.

